<view class="hero"><view class="hero-rule"></view><view class="hero-row"><view><view class="hero-kicker">ESCAPE GARAGE · EST. CAR CARE</view><view class="hero-brand">为热爱上路<br/>做好每一件事</view></view><image class="hero-logo" src="/assets/escape-garage-wordmark.png" mode="aspectFit" style="width:210rpx;height:72rpx;object-fit:contain;object-position:center;background:transparent"/></view><view class="hero-subtitle">洗车、精洗、贴膜与车辆档案。ESCAPE车房，认真照顾每一台车。</view><view class="hero-number">01</view></view>
<view class="container content-offset"><view class="book-card"><view><view class="book-overline">BOOK A BAY</view><view class="book-title">下一次服务，安排好了吗？</view><view class="book-copy">30 秒提交预约，门店确认后为您预留工位。</view></view><button class="book-button" bindtap="goBooking">立即预约</button></view>
  <view class="card balance-card" wx:if="{{isLoggedIn}}"><view class="balance-top"><view><view class="balance-label">{{memberName}} 的会员余额</view><view class="balance">{{balanceText}}</view></view><view class="member-badge">MEMBER</view></view><view class="balance-tip">门店收款后实时同步，所有变动均可追溯</view></view>
  <view class="section-heading">会员车库</view><view class="quick-grid" wx:if="{{isLoggedIn}}"><view class="quick-card" bindtap="goBooking"><view class="quick-icon">01</view><view><view class="quick-title">预约到店</view><view class="quick-desc">洗车、精洗与贴膜</view></view></view><view class="quick-card" bindtap="goVehicles"><view class="quick-icon">02</view><view><view class="quick-title">我的爱车</view><view class="quick-desc">车型与车牌档案</view></view></view><view class="quick-card" bindtap="goLogs"><view class="quick-icon">03</view><view><view class="quick-title">余额流水</view><view class="quick-desc">充值与消费明细</view></view></view><view class="quick-card" bindtap="goFilms"><view class="quick-icon">04</view><view><view class="quick-title">贴膜档案</view><view class="quick-desc">施工记录与质保</view></view></view></view>
  <swiper class="banner" indicator-dots autoplay circular interval="5000" wx:if="{{notices.length}}"><swiper-item wx:for="{{notices}}" wx:key="_id"><image wx:if="{{item.image}}" class="banner-image" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill" /><view wx:else class="banner-title-card">{{item.title}}</view></swiper-item></swiper>
  <view class="login-card" wx:if="{{!loading && !isLoggedIn}}"><view class="login-title">登录后管理你的爱车</view><view class="login-desc">预约、会员余额与每次门店服务都会留存。</view><button class="button-primary" bindtap="goLogin">微信手机号登录</button></view><button class="logout-button" wx:if="{{isLoggedIn}}" bindtap="logout">{{devMode ? "退出演示登录" : "隐藏会员信息"}}</button></view>
